Inicial   & 0.3M &  &    &0M    &  &0M\\
Change & $-2x$ &  &    &  $2x$ & &$x$ \\
Equilibrium  & 0.3$-2x$ &  &    &  $2x$ & &$x$ \\ 
\end{tcolorbox}
